From 2a3a4741916b3775ec8383d9692896fb78aef64d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ariel Aviad <aaviad@habana.ai>
Date: Sun, 16 Mar 2025 10:07:56 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] [SW-221257] g3: automate create littlefs flash image

Add python script to generate LittleFS flash
image to load on flash, that represent serdes configuration

Add A JSON for the script the contains the configuration
for the LittleFS image

Change-Id: I009e1c03472c76b13a5d89a474bbf99d5dbaa9d4
Signed-off-by: Ariel Aviad <aaviad@habana.ai>
---

